### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Place Order
POST http://localhost:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account_id": 1001,
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "price": "150.00",
  "quantity": "10"
}

### Get Live Orderbook Depth
GET http://localhost:8080/book?symbol=AAPL&depth=20

### Deposit via Gateway (credits the authenticated account; requires "trade" permission)
POST http://localhost:8080/deposit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "asset": "CASH",
  "amount": "10000.00"
}

